<mxCell id="gateway" value="API GATEWAY + LOAD BALANCER\nJWT auth | rate limit (1000 req/min) | geo-routing (US-West, EU) | request validation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcc80;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="230" width="900" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="serviceLayer" value="SERVICE LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="310" width="1820" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="searchSvc" value="Search Service\n\nRadius query handler\nFilter coordinator\nCache-first lookup\nFallback to ES/PostGIS\nResponse enrichment" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="360" width="220" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="placeSvc" value="Place Service\n\nCRUD operations\nBusiness registration\nMetadata management\nPhoto upload to S3\nPublish to Kafka" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="360" width="200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="reviewSvc" value="Review Service\n\nSubmit/read reviews\nRating calculation\nModeration queue\nPublish to Kafka" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="360" width="190" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="indexer" value="Indexing Service\n(Kafka Consumer)\n\nConsume place events\nSync to Elasticsearch\nUpdate Redis hot cache\nCommit offsets" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="360" width="210" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="directionSvc" value="Direction Service\n\nRouting API\nDistance matrix\nPolyline generation\nTraffic integration" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="360" width="190" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="dataLayer" value="DATA + INFRASTRUCTURE LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="530" width="1820" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="redis" value="Redis Geo\nGEORADDIUS\ndrivers:online\nplaces:hot:{city}\n\n~50 bytes/point\n1M pts ≈ 50 MB\n&lt;5ms queries\n\nCommands:\nGEOADD\nGEORADIUS\nGEODIST" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="580" width="180" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="es" value="Elasticsearch\ngeo_point field\nBKD tree index\n\nPlaces: 100M docs\nproxim Search + filters\n10-50ms p95\n\nQuery:\n{geo_distance:\n  {distance: '5km',\n   location: {lat, lon}}}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="580" width="220" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pg" value="PostgreSQL + PostGIS\nGEOGRAPHY type\nGIST R-tree index\n\nPlaces: 10M rows\nVincenty formula\nACID source of truth\n\nST_DWithin(\n  location,\n  user_point,\n  5000)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="580" width="220" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="kafka" value="Kafka\nplace.updated topic\nreview.created topic\n\nkey: place_id hash\n7-day retention\n\nConsumer: indexer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="580" width="180" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3" value="S3\nPlace images\nReview photos\n\nCDN:\nCloudFront\n&lt;50ms globally" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce4ec;strokeColor=#c2185b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="580" width="160" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cache" value="Redis\n(metadata)\n\nplace:{id}\nTTL: 1h\n\nQueries top 100\nper city\nTTL: 10 min" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="580" width="160" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="e1" value="GEOADD" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#f57f17;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="searchSvc" target="redis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e2" value="geo_distance query" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="searchSvc" target="es"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e3" value="ST_DWithin fallback" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="searchSvc" target="pg"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e4" value="INSERT/UPDATE" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="placeSvc" target="pg"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e5" value="publish place.updated" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="placeSvc" target="kafka"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e6" value="consume" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="kafka" target="indexer"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e7" value="bulk index" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#f57f17;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="indexer" target="es"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e8" value="cache hot" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#f57f17;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="indexer" target="redis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="why" value="WHY THESE CHOICES\n\nRedis GEORADIUS for hot cache: Top 1000 active places per city (~50 MB per city), cached as query-result JSON (key: search:{lat}:{lng}:{radius}:{category}:{filters}, TTL 10 min). Separate real-time GEO use case (e.g. Uber/Lyft driver locations, drivers:online key): GEOADD upsert on every driver location update (100K drivers × 5s ping = 20K updates/sec), query GEORADIUS drivers:online 77.59 12.97 5 km WITHDIST ASC COUNT 10 → &lt;1ms, expires after 10 min of inactivity.\n\nElasticsearch geo_distance combines proximity + text + filters: Single query handles 'find pizza restaurants open now rating≥4 within 5km' without joining multiple systems. BKD tree (block k-d tree) indexes geo_point for O(log N) lookup. 100M docs across 5-node cluster, ~50ms p95.\n\nPostgreSQL PostGIS as source of truth: All place writes go here first (ACID). GIST R-tree index on GEOGRAPHY type. ST_DWithin uses Vincenty formula (±0.5mm accuracy vs Haversine ±0.5% error). Shard by region (US-West DB, EU DB) with 10km overlap.\n\nBounding box + Haversine pattern: Step 1: lat BETWEEN x AND y, lng BETWEEN a AND b (cheap B-tree scan, 10K candidates from 10M rows). Step 2: Haversine distance on 10K survivors (exact circle). Total: &lt;10ms vs 1000ms without index.\n\nKafka event-driven indexing: Place update → PostgreSQL → publish to Kafka → indexer consumes → bulk write to Elasticsearch (500 docs/batch) + GEOADD to Redis hot cache. Eventual consistency (~1-2s lag) acceptable for places (not real-time like drivers).\n\nGeohash edge case handling: Query center cell + 8 neighbors (9 total SQL LIKE queries or ES terms filter). Post-filter with Haversine to get exact circle. Two points 50m apart on boundary have different prefixes (9q8yyzzz vs 9q8z0000)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="800" width="1800" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
